UID:10065186-1779764400-1779850799@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:COMING JUNE 20th | Big Something
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, June 20th\, 2026 | Doors at 6:00PM | Music at 7:30PM | From $34.17 adv. Event Details and Tickets \nHailing from the North Carolina countryside\, or “The Middle of Nowhere\,” as it’s proudly dubbed on their debut album\, the 6 headed musical monster known as ‘Big Something‘ has steadily become one of the most unique and exciting rock bands to emerge from the Southeast. Their musical alchemy is deeply rooted in the strong bond of its members—Nick MacDaniels [lead vocals\, guitar]\, Jesse Hensley [lead guitar\, vocals]\, Casey Cranford [saxophone\, E.W.I. “Electronic Wind Instrument”]\, Ben Vinograd [drums]\, Josh Kagel [keys\, trumpet]\, and Matt Laird [bass]. \nAfter over a decade of touring together with 7 full-length studio albums and even their own Summer music festival The Big What?\, Big Something has emerged as a grassroots phenomenon in the live music community. \n  \nFounded in 2005\, Pisgah is known for producing some of the most sought after craft ales in Western North Carolina. Pisgah Brewing Company currently operates the new indoor taproom & deli\, with live music several days a week\, plus an open air outdoor bar in the summer and fall months. Check out our upcoming schedule at pisgahbrewing.com/events
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/coming-june-20th-big-something-2-2/2026-05-26/
LOCATION:Pisgah Brewing Company Black Mountain\, 2948 US-70\, Black Mountain\, NC\, 28711
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Black Mountain,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/645500299_1393109482843224_5252979529021024333_n-e1772557144468.jpg
GEO:35.6068069;-82.3568213
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Pisgah Brewing Company Black Mountain 2948 US-70 Black Mountain NC 28711;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=2948 US-70:geo:-82.3568213,35.6068069
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:LiveMusicAsheville.com
