LAST-MODIFIED:20260523T105634Z
UID:10065164-1779764400-1779850799@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:COMING Friday May 29 | Funkwondo Live!
DESCRIPTION:Friday May 29 | 9:00 pm – 12:00 am | $10 Cover\n\n\nFunkwondo is “the art of funk”. The 6-piece funk collective contains Michael Buddy Bullard on guitar & vocals\, Danny Korin on bass & vocals\, Paul Whitsett on keys & vocals\, Zach Willard on lead guitar\, Zach Van Dijk on Trombone (sometimes bass)\, & Serge Mnatsakanov on drums. Let’s just say the band is multi-dimensional\, coming from many different musical backgrounds to bring funk to its core. And so it shall be told.\n\nFounded in Charlotte\, NC circa 2022\, the motif was always to bring a groove to the people that they can catch on to and move with. Funkwondo brings that groove to life and then some with catchy driven riffs\, psychedelic exploration\, improvisational playfulness\, and a soulful attitude. This boastful and exploratory funk has reached a wide range of audiences in the local NC and SC region\, as their following continues to grow. funkwondo.com\n\n\n\n\nWith two unique locations\, built inside buildings that were previously cast aside\, One World brews with the intention of fostering nourishing interaction and artistic cultural experiences. From live music to art shows\, “One World Brewing” is born from the magic that happens when the whole becomes greater than the sum of its parts. Our taprooms are intersections for people of all walks of life and different corners of the globe\, enjoying this time and place together.  Check out our upcoming schedule: click here
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/coming-friday-may-29-funkwondo-live/2026-05-26/
LOCATION:One World Brewing – West\, 520 Haywood Rd\, Asheville\, North Carolina\, 28806
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/670571190_18020022677828376_2571665765265255172_n-e1778804996817.jpg
GEO:35.5783642;-82.5848526
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=One World Brewing – West 520 Haywood Rd Asheville North Carolina 28806;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=520 Haywood Rd:geo:-82.5848526,35.5783642
END:VEVENT
