SUMMARY:Jenny Bradley's Curated Fourth Tuesdays Stevie Nicks Birthday Tribute
DESCRIPTION:The great Stevie Nicks turns 78 on Tuesday May 26 and on that very night we will celebrate her birthday with an all female musical tribute to songs she wrote and sang! Let’s honor our mystical Gemini songstress at The River Arts District Brewing Company for Jenny Bradley’s Curated Fourth Tuesdays Stevie Nicks Tribute Edition! You will hear moving interpretations of her most beloved hits and some obscure gems with everyone closing out the show together!On the bill:Melissa McKinneyAshley HeathSal LandersLillie SyracuseElizabeth McCorveyChristina ChandlerAG HammondKellin WatsonJenny BradleyBlu Belle Bradley BotaElizabeth McCorveyMarisa BlakeAnd some surprise guests!!!Show runs from 7:00 to 9:00Suggested $10 (more or less!)Food truck!
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/jenny-bradleys-curated-fourth-tuesdays/
LOCATION:River Arts District Brewing\, 13 Mystery St\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
GEO:35.5846876;-82.5649928
